<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:50:13 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Yann LeCun 的第二次风险投资基金尝试获得 1 亿美元，Gemini 的共同领导者成为合伙人</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/yann-lecuns-second-attempt-at-a-vc-fund-lands-with-100m-and-geminis-colead-as-a-partner</link><description>LeCun 和 Oriol Vinyals 加入 224 Ventures，这是一家资产超过 1 亿美元的新人工智能基金。它以 100 万至 500 万美元的支票瞄准早期人工智能初创公司。 LP大多是AI内部人士。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/yann-lecuns-second-attempt-at-a-vc-fund-lands-with-100m-and-geminis-colead-as-a-partner.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:50:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/yann-lecuns-second-attempt-at-a-vc-fund-lands-with-100m-and-geminis-colead-as-a-partner</guid></item><item><title>新的光波动方程挑战了物理学如何解释时间之箭</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-new-wave-equation-for-light-challenges-how-physics-explains-the-arrow-of-time</link><description>一个新的加速波方程将变化的光速与相对论、动量守恒和时间箭头联系起来。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-new-wave-equation-for-light-challenges-how-physics-explains-the-arrow-of-time.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:35:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-new-wave-equation-for-light-challenges-how-physics-explains-the-arrow-of-time</guid></item><item><title>受控破解技术将量子点打印成微小像素，以获得更清晰的显示</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/controlled-cracking-technique-prints-quantum-dots-into-tiny-pixels-for-sharper-displays</link><description>最近的技术进步使得电子设备显示器的开发变得越来越复杂、更清晰。许多现代显示器都使用发光二极管（LED），这是一种微型半导体元件，当电流通过时会发光。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/controlled-cracking-technique-prints-quantum-dots-into-tiny-pixels-for-sharper-displays2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:20:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/controlled-cracking-technique-prints-quantum-dots-into-tiny-pixels-for-sharper-displays</guid></item><item><title>亚马逊研究人员声称量子算法可能挑战 PQC 基金会</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/amazon-researcher-claims-quantum-algorithm-could-challenge-pqc-foundations</link><description>Quantum Insider (TQI) 是专门致力于量子计算的领先在线资源。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/amazon-researcher-claims-quantum-algorithm-could-challenge-pqc-foundations.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:05:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/amazon-researcher-claims-quantum-algorithm-could-challenge-pqc-foundations</guid></item><item><title>科学家们发现了铝盾，可以帮助微小的甲壳类动物在马里亚纳海沟的黑暗、接近冰点的海水和巨大的压力下生存</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-uncover-the-aluminium-shield-that-helps-a-tiny-crustacean-survive-darkness-nearfreezing-water-and-crushing-pressure-in-the-mariana-trench</link><description>在太平洋海面以下近七英里处，有一个充满敌意的地方，历史上只有极少数人曾见过它。完全的黑暗、接近冰点的水以及相当于一架喷气式飞机的重量压在一张邮票上的压力定义了这个世界。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-uncover-the-aluminium-shield-that-helps-a-tiny-crustacean-survive-darkness-nearfreezing-water-and-crushing-pressure-in-the-mariana-trench.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 23:50:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-uncover-the-aluminium-shield-that-helps-a-tiny-crustacean-survive-darkness-nearfreezing-water-and-crushing-pressure-in-the-mariana-trench</guid></item><item><title>美国实验室的 DUNE 使用智能触发器来寻找难以捉摸的幽灵粒子</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/us-labs-dune-uses-smart-triggers-to-hunt-elusive-ghost-particles</link><description>费米实验室的 DUNE 实验依靠深度神经网络来处理 PB 级液氩探测器数据。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/us-labs-dune-uses-smart-triggers-to-hunt-elusive-ghost-particles.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 23:35:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/us-labs-dune-uses-smart-triggers-to-hunt-elusive-ghost-particles</guid></item><item><title>化学家释放电子并打破数十年的化学障碍</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/chemists-set-electrons-free-and-break-a-decades-old-chemistry-barrier</link><description>化学家开发出一种催化剂，打破了化学反应中分子接收电子的长期规则。通过将电子直接释放到溶液中，该技术可以解锁以前无法实现的反应以及潜在有用的新分子。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/chemists-set-electrons-free-and-break-a-decades-old-chemistry-barrier.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 23:20:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/chemists-set-electrons-free-and-break-a-decades-old-chemistry-barrier</guid></item><item><title>生产蜘蛛丝是一项生物学壮举，用它来开发药物输送和伤口护理材料</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/producing-spider-silk-is-a-biological-feat-using-it-to-develop-materials-for-drug-delivery-and-wound-care</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 23:05:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/producing-spider-silk-is-a-biological-feat-using-it-to-develop-materials-for-drug-delivery-and-wound-care</guid></item><item><title>NASA瞄准火灾风暴</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nasa-takes-aim-at-fire-storms</link><description>这些野火的产物使它们的创造者变得更糟&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nasa-takes-aim-at-fire-storms.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 22:50:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nasa-takes-aim-at-fire-storms</guid></item><item><title>最古老的巨型岩石扇贝珠表明加州沿海贸易早在几千年前就开始了</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/oldest-known-giant-rock-scallop-bead-suggests-california-coastal-trade-began-millennia-earlier</link><description>考古学家发现了两颗巨大的岩石扇贝珠，将这些地位崇高的装饰品的首次出现时间推后了。这一发现表明，这些珍贵的海洋珠子在距离加利福尼亚海岸数百英里的地方进行交易的时间比之前认为的要早数千年。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/oldest-known-giant-rock-scallop-bead-suggests-california-coastal-trade-began-millennia-earlier2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 22:35:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/oldest-known-giant-rock-scallop-bead-suggests-california-coastal-trade-began-millennia-earlier</guid></item></channel></rss>